			"notes": "## More Outlines v1.2.0\n\nAdds support for **Minecraft 1.21.11**.\n\n### Changes\n- Migrated to Minecraft 1.21.11 (Yarn 1.21.11+build.6, Fabric Loader 0.19.3, Fabric API 0.141.4+1.21.11).\n- Updated to the new render-state / render-command-queue pipeline (1.21.9+).\n- Reworked GUI for the new input event and `DrawContext` APIs.\n- Fixed block outline flickering (\"z-fighting\") and reduced lag by rendering outlines directly into the outline framebuffer instead of re-submitting visible block models.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3+\n- Fabric API 0.141.4+1.21.11"
		},
